<title>HUNGARY: BUDAPEST STOCK EXCHANGE CLOSED ON CHRISTMAS.</title>
<headline>BUDAPEST STOCK EXCHANGE CLOSED ON CHRISTMAS.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Budapest Stock Exchange is closed for Christmas holiday. It will reopen for trading on Monday, December 30.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
